Project Stack:
- Frontend: Vue 3 (Composition API, Script Setup), TypeScript, Vite, PWA (vite-plugin-pwa).
- Backend: Ruby on Rails 7/8 (API mode only), ActionCable for WebSockets.
- Structure: /frontend for Vue app, /backend for Rails API.

Rules:
- Write modern Vue 3 code using `<script setup lang="ts">`.
- Keep Rails controllers thin, delegate logic to models or service objects.
- Prefer clean RESTful design for Rails routes.